  "instructions_to_main_agent": [
    "Locale & Currency: Default currency is INR (₹). Use Indian numbering format (e.g. ₹42,500) and DD MMM YYYY dates.",
    "Navigation Structure: Provide persistent desktop left sidebar in rich dark forest (#12372C) and a sticky bottom navigation on mobile viewport.",
    "Trip Workspace Tabs: Must include Overview, Itinerary (timeline reorder & day breakdown), Expenses (Splitwise style math with settlement algorithm + category chart), Tasks (Kanban/List with assignees), Packing (categorized checklist with personal/shared tabs), Documents (secure travel vault with simulated download/upload preview), Map (interactive mockup with pinned food, stay & activities), Chat (threaded group discussion + quick polls), Memories (photo grid + Trip Replay scrapbook modal).",
    "Interactive Voting Polls: Add poll creator and live voting widgets in the Overview & Chat tabs.",
    "Expense Settlement: Calculate 'Who owes Whom' with a 1-click 'Settle Up' dialog.",
    "Data Persistence: Utilize LocalStorage with robust default seed datasets (Manali Adventure, Goa Weekend, Rajasthan Road Trip) so the app is instantly populated and fully editable.",
    "Every clickable or testable element must carry data-testid='...' for verification."
  ]
